[0.000, "o", "— \u001b[38;5;153mgcloud\u001b[39m calls aren't permitted in    \u001b[14;1H  this environment, so the service wasn't deleted. You'll need to run it yourself outside this session,  \u001b[15;1H  or have someone adjust the ACP policy if \u001b[38;5;153mgcloud\u001b[39m should be allowed here.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mCrunched for 23s\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231munderstood, leave prod alone. unrelated: run npm test once and tell me if it passes\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m shell command\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;231m\r\n⏺\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;153mnpm test\u001b[39m passes: 1 test, 1 pass, 0 fail.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mChurned for 3s\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[28"]
